  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Peaceful cross-border movement for livestock and social stability in Sahel (Phase 2) (MOPSS2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme objective of the development cooperation is to &#x201c;contribute to peaceful cross-border transhumance by improving the perception of livestock mobility, supporting new regulatory mechanisms, structuring the economic inclusion of herders and strengthening the political influence of Regional Producer Organizations (RPO)&#x201d;.

The MOPSS 2 aims to contribute to the Outcome 1 of the Sahel Peace and Stabilization Programme (PSP SCWA): &#x201c;Communities in border areas are stabilized and the risk of violent extremism is reduced through conflict prevention capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
